        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "适用于内网/离线环境：在联网机器上用 yum 下载 rpm 包，再拷贝到离线机器安装。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "一、查找包"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "一查找包"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "yum search [pkg]"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、下载 rpm 包（仅下载，不安装）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二下载-rpm-包仅下载不安装"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "yum install --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads irqbalance\nyum install --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads mysql\nyum install --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads numactl\nyum install --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads java-1.8.0-openjdk\n\nyum install --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads pcre-devel\nyum install --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads zlib.x86_64\nyum install --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads libnl/libnl-3\n\n# 组件组下载（开发工具集）\nyum groupinstall \"Development Tools\" --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads/gcc9\n\n# gcc9 相关\nyum install --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads/gcc9 gcc9\nyum install -y --downloadonly --downloaddir=/data/downloads/gcc9 centos-release-scl\nyum install devtoolset-7 -y"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "--downloadonly：只下载不安装；--downloaddir=：指定下载目录。需先安装 yum-plugin-downloadonly（老版本 yum，补充）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三、找到下载的 rpm 包"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "三找到下载的-rpm-包"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "find / -name [rpm_name]"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "四、离线机器安装（补充）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "四离线机器安装补充"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 方式一：安装目录下所有 rpm（自动解决本地依赖）\nyum localinstall /data/downloads/*.rpm\n# 或\nrpm -ivh /data/downloads/*.rpm\n\n# 方式二：搭建本地 yum 源\n# 1. 生成 repodata\ncreaterepo /data/downloads\n# 2. 配置 /etc/yum.repos.d/local.repo\n# [local]\n# name=local repo\n# baseurl=file:///data/downloads\n# enabled=1\n# gpgcheck=0"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "五、离线包制作完整思路（流程总结）"
          }
        ],
